    "physical consequence, not a task step.",
    "closure = n-th reedClosed of that reed over the whole run.",
    "trailedSwitches is EMPTY: the Gruppe B route never trails a switch. That empty set is a",
    "real constraint, not a placeholder — for a switch the route only ever trails, whether it",
    "trails is the ONLY observable that constrains its §8 coilToBranch mapping. A measured",
    "mutation survey showed the reed/speed sequence alone misses B xW02BH1G4, xW04C,",
    "xW02BH3G2, xW01D, xW02D and xW04D; pinning the empty trailed set catches all six."
  ],
